> +                       }
> +                       break;
> +               default:
> +                       BUG();
> +                       break;
> +               }
> +       }

This part can be moved into amdgpu_gfx. But I would remove the switch (me_id) part and just go over all gfx and compute rings to search for the matching me and pipe.

Regards,
Christian.

